4. Competitive Landscape & Architectural Differentiation
Prompt caching and context-aware routing have emerged as critical focus areas across the AI ecosystem. Industry initiatives
(such as Red Hat/Google/IBM's llm-d, vLLM's automatic prefix caching, and SGLang's RadixAttention) have successfully
demonstrated that context reuse dramatically improves throughput.
However, existing frameworks operate purely in the software layer and treat physical GPU hardware as a black box. The table
