Summary for Collaborative Technical Review:
ThermaCache AI addresses the unquantified trade-off between prefix-cache locality and GPU thermal power limits. By combining
probabilistic fast-path hints (Cuckoo filters) with out-of-band DCGM telemetry and P2C scheduling, the architecture achieves a 90%
cache hit rate and ~68% TTFT reduction while capping peak GPU junction temperatures at 63°C. We welcome technical feedback,
benchmark peer review, and collaboration on open-source Rust gateway implementations.
